{
  "$schema": "https://schemas.cerberauth.com/identity-provider/draft/2024-09/provider.schema.json",
  "name": "Authgear",
  "abstract": "Open-source customer identity platform written in Go, available as Authgear Cloud or self-hosted on PostgreSQL under Apache-2.0. Covers password, passwordless OTP, magic link, passkey, biometric and social sign-in, TOTP and SMS or email MFA, OIDC and SAML SSO, an OAuth provider for MCP and AI agents, roles and groups, an Authentication Flow API for custom UIs, events and hooks, and fraud, bot and brute-force protection. Cloud pricing is flat monthly tiers with a free plan, built by Oursky in Hong Kong.",
